# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Maintainer: replace APP_ with an application-specific prefix.
# Remove unused settings. This is a scaffold, not a runnable application.
# Users copy this file to .env only when customization is needed.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required settings
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Add required secrets without usable defaults, then remove this heading when
# the deployment has no required values.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional settings
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Browser port on the Docker host.
# APP_PORT=8080

# Local access by default. Document how to enable trusted LAN access.
# APP_BIND_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1

# Leave this line commented to use the Docker-managed named volume.
# Uncomment it and enter an absolute Linux host path after = only when needed.
# Absolute Linux paths begin with /.
# Changing the source does not move existing data and can change permissions,
# backup and restore behavior.
# Read the deployment README before changing this value.
# APP_DATA_SOURCE=

# Optional name for a maintained shared-network extension.
# STACKLAB_NETWORK=stacklab

# Add supported native application variables, with comments.
